# Career Pipeline Overview

This workspace runs a structured job search: resume design, exports, and application tracking with AI-assisted workflows from the **career-pipeline** plugin.

## Folder map

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `design/` | Editable source files (resume, cover letter template) |
| `design/exports/` | Finished PDFs ready to submit |
| `leads/` | Company research profiles produced by `source-leads` |
| `submissions/` | Per-company, per-role application tracking |
| `submissions/.archive/` | Closed applications |

## Submissions path

Live: `submissions/<Company>/<Job Title>/`

## Leads path

Company research: `leads/<Company>.md`

## Personal context

Read workspace-root `.career-pipeline.yml` for salary floor, location preferences, target roles, background facts, and naming patterns. Do not hardcode candidate-specific details in rules or skills. Field guide: plugin `docs/config.md` (or `docs/customization.md` in this workspace).

## Workflows

Invoke skills explicitly: `source-leads`, `analyze-job`, `initial-interview`, `next-interview`, `archive-job`. Human workflow guide: root `README.md`.
